      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "The Women’s, Gender, and Sexuality Studies, B.A. is ALSO offered through Extended Learning . Please see the 25-26 Catalog for more information.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><strong><em>The Women’s,&nbsp;Gender, and Sexuality Studies, B.A. is ALSO offered through&nbsp;</em></strong><a href=\"https://www.csusm.edu/el/programs/public-service/ba-womens-gender-sexuality-studies/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>Extended Learning</em></strong></a><strong><em>.</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><em>﻿</em>Please see the<a href=\"https://catalog.csusm.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=11&amp;poid=2617&amp;returnto=1994\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> 25-26 Catalog</a> for more information.</p>"
